<div class="dm-service-section">
<div class="dm-container">
<div class="dm-flex">
<div class="dm-full">
<h3>Symptoms of Depression</h3>
<ul>
<li>Persistent feelings of sadness or emptiness</li>
<li>Loss of interest in activities once enjoyed</li>
<li>Changes in appetite or weight</li>
<li>Sleep disturbances (insomnia or oversleeping)</li>
<li>Difficulty concentrating</li>
<li>Low energy or fatigue</li>
<li>Feelings of guilt, worthlessness, or hopelessness</li>
<li>Suicidal thoughts or behaviors</li>
</ul>
<p>If these symptoms last more than two weeks, it may be clinical depression.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
